WEBVTT

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:02.670
See you tomorrow!

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:06.300
I'm a bit peckish.

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.270
Me, too.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.140
Want to go get something to eat?

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:10.340
How about some jimanyaki?

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:12.000
That sounds good!

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.660
Yeah, let's go!

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.970
That's a nice face.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:23.320
See you tomorrow!

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:28.130
<i>Hm? You're asking yourself what I am?</i>

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.210
<i>Since you asked, I'll do you a favor.</i>

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.540
<i>I'll tell you the story 
of how I came to be here.</i>

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:38.610
<i>On that faithful summer day, 
I was just a pile of clay.</i>

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:43.100
<i>I was dug up from one of the best potter's 
clay mining pits in Gifu prefecture,</i>

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:47.230
<i>underwent many processing stages, and was 
finally shipped out as pottery clay.</i>

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:50.420
<i>While I feel like I should be heavy,
 I'm actually quite light,</i>

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:52.400
<i>which is indispensable for 
Shino ware or Oribe ware.</i>

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:53.290
<i>That's right!</i>

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:57.480
<i>I am the proud clay that represents 
the capital of pottery, Mino—</i>

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:08.500
Rough
Wedging

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:02.840
<i>This technique is called 
"araneri," or rough wedging.</i>

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:07.700
<i>Each step represents a serious 
battle between the stepper and me!</i>

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:10.680
Hime-chan, you should come dance, too!

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:13.000
It feels cold and so good.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.010
Really? I'll join you!

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.930
<i>W-Wait, what?!</i>

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:20.560
Summer break! So much fun!

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:23.230
<i>Hey! Not so rough!</i>

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:25.520
Hey! What are you fooling around for?!

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:03.780
<b>The Mumblings of the Clay</b>

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:04.030
You need to show respect towards the clay.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:08.870
Pug
Mill

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:06.930
It's not just about 
stepping on it, you know?

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:08.880
We're sorry.

00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:10.600
<i>You tell 'em!</i>

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:12.370
I brought some snacks.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.860
Why don't you come take a break?

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.290
It <i>is</i> summer break after all.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.060
Yay!

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:20.540
<i>So it looks I was not sent to 
one of the famous potters,</i>

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:24.380
<i>but to a place full of 
youngsters learning pottery.</i>

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:28.120
<i>To make matters worse, this school is soft!</i>

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:28.890
<i>Too soft!</i>

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:34.530
<i>I think the only person who could do 
me justice here is the forehead girl.</i>

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:31.320
Will you join us, Aoki-san?

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:33.460
Yes, thank you.

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:39.390
<i>Look how powerfully, yet 
gently she handles the clay.</i>

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:42.420
<i>She really has a promising 
future ahead of her.</i>

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:44.190
<i>If this girl were to shape 
me into something,</i>

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:46.150
<i>then even I would...</i>

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:48.110
Touko-senpai, hurry up!

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:49.620
The popsicles are going to melt!

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.010
<i>Oh, not her again!</i>

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:54.360
Come, come! They're tasty!

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:54.360
<i>And what's with those yellow curls?!</i>

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:56.920
Owww, my funny bone!

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.730
<i>So much crashing around and yelling,</i>

00:03:57.110 --> 00:03:59.010
I'm dying!

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:01.890
<i>that can no longer be classified 
as a lack of calm!</i>

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:01.260
The numbness is setting in!

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:06.010
Please console me, my dear pieces/friends.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:09.150
<i>The pieces she's made are all wonky too.</i>

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:11.320
<i>For such a noble piece 
of clay such as myself,</i>

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:13.430
<i>anything but that, please!</i>

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:20.420
<i>Now I will sleep here for several days.</i>

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.660
<i>That increases my plasticity, 
which makes me easier to mold.</i>

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:26.930
<i>Additionally, the particles in my clay will 
become finer, which prevents shrinking.</i>

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:35.330
<i>So who will be the one to give me my form?</i>

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:42.820
<i>Forehead! Phew!</i>

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:45.800
Spiral
wedging

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:48.050
<i>Forehead, go ahead and use me to your 
heart's content to unlock your talent—</i>

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.620
It's ready, Mika-chan.

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.050
<i>Say what?!</i>

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:52.410
Thank you, Touko-senpai!

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:59.320
First, we go like this!

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:06.000
Oh, are you coiling?

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:09.840
Yeah, I want to make something 
special, so I'm making it big.

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:12.330
But won't making it big be hard?

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.580
Don't underestimate a Tajimi girl!

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:18.080
I've been doing pottery since I was 
a little kid, so I'm a veteran!

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:20.590
And I've done my homework!

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:23.110
<i>That's... That's right!</i>

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:26.150
<i>She might actually turn out to 
have formidable pottery skills.</i>

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:27.840
<i>I mustn't give up just yet!</i>

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:31.960
So that looks... sinister...

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:38.710
It's cute, huh?

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:41.760
It seems like... hmm, is this 
supposed to be like that god?

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:43.500
I feel like this looks similar.

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:45.600
Yes, it's a friend!

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:48.400
All right, we'll continue tomorrow!

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:56.180
<i>It's over. I'm over.</i>

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:07.970
<b>Café Tokishirou</b>

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.550
Today's blend is very refreshing.

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:10.750
Instead of the usual 
Kilimanjaro and robusta,

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:13.260
I think this is Mocha and Guatemala.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.690
Heavy on the Mocha.

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:16.270
You're quite the expert.

00:06:16.860 --> 00:06:19.380
I just guessed.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:23.890
You're not going to the pottery 
club during summer break?

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:28.700
The beauty is in not going there on purpose.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.260
I hear you.

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:32.000
I was the same.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:39.500
<i>So why am I getting kneaded again?</i>

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:42.240
Huh, you started over?

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:44.530
Yeah, this is my fourth attempt.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:46.410
I feel like I am finally starting to see it.

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:49.880
I see, but isn't wedging it over 
and over really a lot of work?

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.750
Why don't you just use new clay?

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:54.090
<i>Finally, the voice of reason!</i>

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:56.300
<i>You should use a new piece of clay!</i>

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:59.480
<i>And then let Forehead-senpai 
take care of me!</i>

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:02.040
No can do. It has to be this clay!

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:04.020
Why?

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:06.010
Because this is the last.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:11.030
Because this clay is... um...

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:13.030
Gotomaki clay.

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:15.320
That's right, Gotomaki!

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:17.330
This is special clay that 
was mined at Gotomaki,

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:19.550
which is in the next town over, Toki City.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:22.830
It's the clay that was traditionally 
used for Mino ware.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.740
It used to be mined in 
Kani and Oogaya as well,

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.990
but it's basically all been mined up.

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:33.340
That's why this is the last batch of 
Gotomaki clay in our pottery club.

00:07:33.780 --> 00:07:37.140
<i>Yes. That's a rather sad story.</i>

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:41.510
And that's why I thought I should 
make something special with it.

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:43.820
So that's why you're going to make 
a friend for the god outside.

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:49.330
Yup! I heard before that that god 
is also made out of Gotomaki clay.

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:53.050
<i>Harumph. So you knew all along.</i>

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:54.910
<i>Then you should take making 
me more seriously.</i>

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.700
<i>You fool.</i>

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.000
It's done!

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:02.430
Wow, that's really good!

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:03.840
Right?

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:08.190
<i>It's certainly a lot better 
than when she first started.</i>

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:11.330
I'm going to put a heart on there.

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:12.320
<i>No, no, no, no!</i>

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:15.120
<i>Stop, stop, stop!</i>

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:19.350
This weather is perfect for sun drying.

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:24.340
You dry properly now.

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:26.850
We don't want you cracking 
up during the firing.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.970
<i>So... hot...</i>

00:08:34.300 --> 00:08:38.350
At this rate, it won't 
even take a week to dry.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:41.040
I'm so excited!

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:44.380
...huh?

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:47.500
<i>Yellow-curls! Did you finally notice?!</i>

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.210
<i>Do something already!</i>

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:04.110
I'm sorry. You must've been so cold.

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:07.170
<i>I-I'm fine. You should dry yourself, too.</i>

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:19.740
Biscue
Firing

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:17.030
<i>I was good and patient.</i>

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:23.750
Underglaze

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:26.760
Kukuri Mika, going in for the eyes!

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:29.300
<i>Hey, Yellow-curls?</i>

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:31.040
<i>A doll lives and dies with its face!</i>

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.800
<i>Please be careful! Careful, you hear?!</i>

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:35.320
Heya!

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:36.850
We brought snacks!

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:38.810
We've got sweet red bean 
soup with dumplings!

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:40.190
Really?!

00:09:51.850 --> 00:09:54.140
I'm so sorry, Kukuri-san.

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:56.320
This is because we were so loud...

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:01.880
Look at this face, though!

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:04.270
<i>What are you laughing at?!</i>

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:05.650
This is awesome!

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:08.380
It'll be amazing if I go like this!

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:12.310
How lucky are you to get such a funny face?

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:14.080
<i>This is the worst!</i>

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.670
<i>I guess this isn't that bad.</i>

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:24.470
<i>I didn't hate that smile.</i>

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.100
Glaze

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:26.470
Dunk!

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:27.100
<i>So cold!</i>

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:29.190
<i>Why are you so rough?!</i>

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:32.340
It's finally time, Kukuri-chan.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:36.150
I was worried since it's so big, 
but you did a great job, Mika-chan!

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:37.550
<i>Seriously.</i>

00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:41.910
<i>I was worried too, but 
I turned out pretty well.</i>

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:46.160
Kukuri Mika is someone who 
can get the job done!

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:48.160
Please make it through the firing all right.

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:57.870
<i>You leave it to me.</i>

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:00.880
<i>I'm going to fire up perfectly!</i>

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:04.050
<i>Nothing to worry about.</i>

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:09.190
<i>That goofy girl really 
got serious about this.</i>

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:11.390
<i>It'll go just fine.</i>

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:14.120
<i>Guaranteed.</i>

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:24.460
<i>Oh, it's Forehead.</i>

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:26.310
<i>I guess I'm already fired, then.</i>

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:28.280
<i>Hurry, get me out of here.</i>

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:41.420
Th-That can be fixed, right, Touko-senpai?

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:44.640
Actually, if the hole is that big...

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:50.760
<i>Yellow-curls, I wanted to make you happy...</i>

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.170
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.870
He's so cute!

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.520
He's so cute, so adorable!

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:03.140
I'm so proud of myself!

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:04.380
Mika-chan?

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:06.200
What about that hole?

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:09.650
It's fine! I just had a good idea!

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:13.870
<i>What... are you going to do?</i>

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:17.050
I wasn't expecting that.

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:19.020
Ninja technique: hole hiding.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:24.680
<i>That's genius, Yellow-curls.</i>

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:26.690
That's really pretty!

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:30.070
I'll plant something new every season.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.550
So enjoy your decoration.

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:36.430
<i>Yellow-curls...</i>

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:43.320
<i>Once, I was clay.</i>

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:48.470
<i>I was dug up from one of the best potter's 
clay mining pits in Gifu prefecture,</i>

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:52.490
<i>underwent many processing 
stages, and ended up here.</i>

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:56.440
<i>Oh, that reminds me, I still 
haven't introduced myself.</i>

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:59.000
<i>My name is Mad Demon.</i>

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:04.500
<i>I am the proud creation of Yellow-curls.</i>

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:07.480
<i>Pleased to make your acquaintance.</i>

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:27.630
The fun cultural festival 
is approaching fast!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:35.350
<b>Mini-mini Pottery Club</b>

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:32.110
But the bob-haired girl sees 
Forehead looking forlorn...

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:35.010
Next time, we have 
 "What's Wrong, Touko-Senpai?"

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:38.820
Teach us something about 
Touko-senpai, Grandpa.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:40.010
<b>Next Time:</b>

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:40.010
<b>What's Wrong, Touko-senpai?</b>
